name issue_152_capacity_drop_v2
describe capacity_drop with every v2 switch on, traced next to libwebrtc (yardstick for issue #152)
# Same link as capacity_drop. Queue p95 is 353 ms against libwebrtc's 283 (issue #152); the expect lines are capacity_drop's.
cc v2
pacer v2
tcc v2
rtx v2
rtcp v2
keyframe v2
allocator v2
packetization v2
audio v2
duration 40s
at 0s  capacity=2500kbps delay=30ms queue=400ms
at 10s capacity=500kbps
at 25s capacity=2500kbps
expect audio.interruptions <= 1
expect video.longest_freeze_ms < 4000
